      "matters": "ORDER TO SHOW CAUSE FOR CHANGE OF NAME<br>Off Calendar Dec-20-2012 Granted Per Written Order<br>MINI MINUTES: This cause came on regularly as scheduled this day for OSC hearing for Name Change.<br>Dept. 514, Judge: Ellen Chaitin, Clerk: Yolanda Mazariegos, CSR: Sonia Wong, #11288.<br>Clifford Y. Wang, Esq., appearing of behalf of Petitioner.<br>Petitioner mother of minor XiuLing Li presen in court.<br>Petitioner XiuLIng Li sworn and examined through Cantonese Interpreter Cliffornd Wang. <br>Proof of Publication on file.<br>Order dispensing with Notice to other parent on file.<br><br>No objections to the proposed change of name were made at the hearing.<br>It appears to the satisfaction of the Court that all the allegations in the petition are true, correct and suffcient, and the petition should be granted.<br>The court grants the petition for Change of Name from Shi Hua Huang to Eva Shihua Huang.<br>Decree Changing Name signed in open court.<br>",
